Integral — Authors & Maintainers
================================

Integral is a conformable application substrate for agent
queryability and human interfacing, built on jvspatial with
the native Integral AI resident powered by Pydantic AI.

Creator & Lead Maintainer
  Eldon Marks (@eldonm) — https://github.com/eldonm

Contributors
  This list grows with the project. Contributions are welcome.

